====== MikroTik RouterBoard RB91xG 5HPnD (RB911/RB912)======

There appears to be a new revision of this board, which has an ethernet problem [[https://dev.openwrt.org/ticket/17385]].
It is distinguishable by the NANYA DDR memory on board.
The ticket was closed on 2015-06-25. Ethernet is now reported working on Chaos Calmer.


